51:02.668 --> 51:12.133
[SPEAKER_01]: it creates a force that is drag. The higher is the strength of the wake, the higher is the drag yielded. So installing a tail there dampens these

51:12.213 --> 51:21.514
[SPEAKER_01]: wakes and so the drag can be decreased as well. So that's the idea behind using tails and cocoons. Makes sense. You know, I was just curious, like

